<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges up to 1.8180 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges up to 1.8180 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8180 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8210 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  May 6		May 5</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8180	     1.8210</p>
<p> Volume traded			$25.81 million	 $69.23 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
